comment: Note that the overall reaction representing three successive executions of this activity is N1,N5,N10-triferuloyl spermidine + 3 NADPH + 3 O2 = N1,N5,N10-tri-(hydroxyferuloyl)-spermidine + 3 NADP+ + 3 H2O; this corresponds to the MetaCyc reaction RXN-11262 (http://biocyc.org/META/NEW-IMAGE?type=REACTION&object=RXN-11262) and the KEGG reaction R08986 (http://www.genome.jp/dbget-bin/www_bget?rn:R08986).
